{"sections":[{"slug":"线性范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"线性范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">线性范畴</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“线性范畴”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">为域</span>. $k$-<span lang=\"zh\">线性范畴是一个加性范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其态射集具有</span> $k$-<span lang=\"zh\">线性空间的结构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">态射的复合是</span> $k$-<span lang=\"zh\">线性的</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">谈论</span> $k$-<span lang=\"zh\">线性范畴之间的函子时</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">也假定其在态射集上的映射是</span> $k$-<span lang=\"zh\">线性的</span>.</p>\n"}}}]}